Cross-machine reproducibility is verified through invariant equivalence.

\subsection{5. Stress Sovereignty Evaluation}
Maximum-load stress tests are applied across all domains. The system must
maintain:
\[
\text{Integrity} = 100\%,\qquad
\text{Convergence} = \text{Absolute}.
\]

Stress sovereignty is achieved when all invariants remain locked under
simultaneous multi-domain saturation.

